WEBVTT

01:40.220 --> 01:44.210
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.060 --> 01:47.160
[Episode 19]

01:50.280 --> 01:51.870
What is this thing for?

01:52.430 --> 01:54.350
This? It's an iron chisel.

01:54.950 --> 01:55.789
How do you use it?

01:57.560 --> 01:58.789
The iron chisel is used like this.

02:00.900 --> 02:01.950
May I try it?

02:02.590 --> 02:03.400
Sure.

02:03.840 --> 02:04.640
Thank you.

02:05.640 --> 02:06.640
It's just a piece of iron.

02:06.640 --> 02:07.920
What's so interesting about it?

02:08.520 --> 02:09.310
Madam.

02:12.400 --> 02:13.190
Tanyin.

02:13.680 --> 02:15.360
This cabinet you made is really beautiful.

02:15.680 --> 02:16.520
You have very dexterous hands.

02:19.870 --> 02:20.710
This Pei Jiu,

02:20.710 --> 02:22.360
he was supposed to come and try on his wedding outfit.

02:22.380 --> 02:24.130
It's already past noon, and there's still no sign of him.

02:24.430 --> 02:26.400
I bet that muddlehead forgot again.

02:27.630 --> 02:28.430
Qian Lin.

02:28.829 --> 02:29.829
Do me a small favor

02:29.960 --> 02:31.450
and try on the wedding outfit for Pei Jiu.

02:31.520 --> 02:32.240
Me?

02:32.960 --> 02:33.910
Try on the wedding outfit?

02:33.960 --> 02:35.079
Yes, you.

02:35.430 --> 02:36.420
You carry on, Tanyin.

02:36.490 --> 02:37.300
Let's go, let's go.

02:38.150 --> 02:39.400
I'll go with you.

02:45.190 --> 02:46.680
It fits you quite well.

02:46.860 --> 02:47.680
Then, won't it be

02:47.680 --> 02:49.000
a bit too large for Pei Jiu?

02:49.910 --> 02:51.150
Turn around and let me see.

02:52.690 --> 02:53.530
Turn this way.

02:57.760 --> 02:58.800
He's taller than Pei Jiu.

02:58.820 --> 03:00.500
Then the length should be fine, right?

03:00.810 --> 03:02.690
The length seems fine.

03:04.080 --> 03:04.800
But if the shoulders

03:04.800 --> 03:06.190
could be taken in a bit,

03:06.210 --> 03:07.280
it would be more suitable

03:07.280 --> 03:08.400
for Pei Jiu.

03:09.130 --> 03:10.180
I think so too.

03:11.010 --> 03:12.970
He looks quite good in this wedding attire.

03:15.070 --> 03:17.070
Isn't he fairer than Pei Jiu?

03:19.840 --> 03:20.870
Fairer?

03:21.120 --> 03:22.400
I think they look about the same.

03:22.470 --> 03:23.400
About the same?

03:23.510 --> 03:24.950
Why do I feel he's much fairer?

03:25.560 --> 03:27.370
Can you just focus on the outfit?

03:28.030 --> 03:29.000
Stand still and don't move around.

03:30.290 --> 03:31.329
Alright, that should be enough.

03:31.400 --> 03:32.240
Let's leave it at that.

03:32.240 --> 03:32.960
Wait a moment.

03:34.400 --> 03:35.190
The hat.

03:35.430 --> 03:36.520
I was just teasing Pei Jiu for being forgetful,

03:36.520 --> 03:37.800
but mine is just as bad.

03:37.800 --> 03:38.590
I forgot to bring the hat.

03:38.590 --> 03:39.520
Wait here. I'll go get it.

03:40.630 --> 03:41.470
In a moment!

03:54.960 --> 03:55.910
How old are you?

03:56.470 --> 03:57.280
"How old are you?"

03:58.280 --> 04:00.030
Only children are asked such questions.

04:00.030 --> 04:01.470
Aren't you just a child?

04:02.000 --> 04:03.150
I bet you're not even married yet.

04:03.150 --> 04:04.030
I'm not young at all.

04:04.560 --> 04:05.310
At my age,

04:05.310 --> 04:06.400
if I were living in my clan,

04:06.400 --> 04:07.490
I'd have several children by now.

04:08.130 --> 04:08.710
I...

04:09.260 --> 04:10.740
I just wanted to wait a bit longer.

04:12.860 --> 04:13.580
I really wouldn't have guessed

04:13.600 --> 04:15.120
that you come from a big family.

04:15.470 --> 04:16.560
Where is your home?

04:20.920 --> 04:22.000
A place far away.

04:23.240 --> 04:24.190
You don't want to say it?

04:24.360 --> 04:25.160
It's okay.

04:25.390 --> 04:26.800
You don't have to say if you don't want to.

04:28.480 --> 04:30.040
My home is also far away.

04:31.000 --> 04:32.560
Probably even farther than yours.

04:33.190 --> 04:34.270
I don't want to talk about it either.

04:53.120 --> 04:55.120
What exactly is your relationship

04:55.510 --> 04:56.800
with that Mr. Yuan?

04:58.070 --> 04:59.000
Master and servant, I suppose.

05:00.630 --> 05:01.430
If,

05:01.430 --> 05:02.430
I mean if,

05:03.040 --> 05:04.240
if he were in danger,

05:05.120 --> 05:08.360
would you be... sad and upset?

05:08.800 --> 05:09.830
In danger?

05:13.440 --> 05:16.050
Like what happened on the tower ship before.

05:16.480 --> 05:18.390
If he were to get hurt...

05:18.750 --> 05:19.550
If he...

05:23.630 --> 05:24.430
Then...

05:24.600 --> 05:26.240
then I would definitely protect him.

05:28.940 --> 05:31.390
[Yesterday's Inn]

05:52.240 --> 05:53.510
You're still up so late?

05:54.159 --> 05:54.830
I'm not tired.

05:55.480 --> 05:56.630
I see you've been busy all along.

05:57.159 --> 05:58.000
Have some water.

06:00.120 --> 06:01.480
It's clean. I haven't used it.

06:02.760 --> 06:03.430
Thank you.

06:03.920 --> 06:05.600
No, I should be the one thanking you.

06:05.830 --> 06:06.830
You saved my life.

06:06.920 --> 06:08.560
You've already thanked me many times for it.

06:08.950 --> 06:10.560
Then let me thank you once more.

06:22.950 --> 06:25.040
You seem... upset.

06:25.120 --> 06:25.830
How can you tell

06:25.830 --> 06:26.830
that I'm upset?

06:27.520 --> 06:29.310
Earlier, I wasn't completely unconscious

06:29.340 --> 06:30.630
when I was in a coma.

06:30.870 --> 06:32.390
I vaguely saw you.

06:32.950 --> 06:33.950
At that time,

06:34.070 --> 06:35.630
your smile was far more genuine than it is now.

06:42.510 --> 06:43.600
What's making you upset?

06:43.870 --> 06:45.800
Would you like to talk about it?

06:47.190 --> 06:48.270
I have a friend.

06:49.360 --> 06:50.830
She has a very good male friend.

06:51.480 --> 06:53.270
But for some reason,

06:53.270 --> 06:54.310
he seems to be angry.

06:54.600 --> 06:56.040
Even though he's clearly in the room,

06:57.120 --> 06:58.390
he pretends not to be there

06:58.720 --> 06:59.920
and won't let her in.

07:01.000 --> 07:01.800
It seems like

07:02.020 --> 07:03.340
he's deliberately avoiding her.

07:08.240 --> 07:10.870
Did they... have a fight?

07:12.040 --> 07:12.830
A fight?

07:16.270 --> 07:17.070
No, they didn't.

07:17.680 --> 07:18.600
Some people

07:18.660 --> 07:19.690
are just like that.

07:19.840 --> 07:21.840
Moody and ruthless.

07:22.510 --> 07:23.430
They can't change.

07:23.750 --> 07:24.750
It's their nature.

07:25.190 --> 07:26.360
That's not true at all.

07:27.270 --> 07:28.430
I think it is.

07:28.750 --> 07:29.920
Go tell that friend of yours

07:30.040 --> 07:30.870
to be careful.

07:31.680 --> 07:32.470
Or maybe...

07:33.560 --> 07:34.690
you should find a new friend instead.

07:37.270 --> 07:38.390
Forget it. Let's not talk about it anymore.

07:38.390 --> 07:39.600
You wouldn't understand anyway.

07:47.050 --> 07:48.970
Where did all these chicken feathers come from?

07:49.600 --> 07:50.600
Did a weasel get in?

07:53.120 --> 07:53.800
Hello, Jiu.

07:55.480 --> 07:56.510
You're sweeping, Liu.

07:57.430 --> 07:58.560
What good stuff are you holding?

08:00.270 --> 08:01.070
It's a secret.

08:01.680 --> 08:02.480
Go away, go away.

08:04.280 --> 08:05.280
Who's Liu?

08:06.380 --> 08:06.960
Yunniang.

08:08.950 --> 08:09.800
Why are you here?

08:09.800 --> 08:10.720
Aren't you busy today?

08:10.870 --> 08:12.310
Of course, I'm busy.

08:12.600 --> 08:14.560
But no matter how busy I am, I have to prioritize what's important.

08:14.560 --> 08:15.110
Look.

08:16.630 --> 08:17.560
Didn't you say

08:17.630 --> 08:18.750
you wanted to follow the old tradition

08:18.750 --> 08:20.240
of setting off fireworks the night before the wedding?

08:20.980 --> 08:21.940
I brought some for you.

08:22.750 --> 08:23.950
Quick, get me a bowl of water.

08:26.360 --> 08:28.160
Why make such a fuss over these few things?

08:29.070 --> 08:29.920
Don't get me started.

08:30.040 --> 08:31.480
Just now, I don't know why,

08:32.150 --> 08:32.870
but I couldn't find

08:32.870 --> 08:34.360
the way to your inn.

08:36.150 --> 08:37.200
Were you going in circles?

08:37.320 --> 08:38.120
No.

08:40.549 --> 08:41.909
I was just wandering around,

08:41.909 --> 08:43.080
unable to remember how to get here.

08:43.630 --> 08:44.720
Lately,

08:44.750 --> 08:46.240
things have been quite strange for me.

08:46.390 --> 08:47.390
I can't sleep well at night,

08:47.610 --> 08:48.300
and when I do sleep,

08:48.320 --> 08:49.610
I keep having lots of dreams.

08:50.000 --> 08:51.270
They feel like they're about someone else's life

08:51.920 --> 08:53.070
or maybe from my past life.

08:53.320 --> 08:55.120
But when I wake up, I can't remember any of it.

08:56.150 --> 08:57.720
I've been worried about forgetting things lately.

08:57.910 --> 08:58.720
Look.

08:59.240 --> 09:00.000
Now, I write everything

09:00.000 --> 09:01.550
down in this little notebook.

09:02.250 --> 09:02.940
Look.

09:03.670 --> 09:04.480
The last one.

09:04.790 --> 09:06.480
"Sending fireworks to Yunniang."

09:08.960 --> 09:10.390
If it weren't for this note,

09:10.600 --> 09:12.390
I'm afraid I would have forgotten about this entirely.

09:14.750 --> 09:15.390
Oh, right.

09:21.000 --> 09:21.790
Yunniang,

09:22.160 --> 09:24.160
take a look at it and see if you like it.

09:30.480 --> 09:31.600
Such a precious thing.

09:31.630 --> 09:32.790
Where did you get it?

09:32.790 --> 09:33.600
Well, I

09:34.000 --> 09:35.720
saved money for a long time

09:36.070 --> 09:37.340
to buy

09:37.870 --> 09:39.270
the only pearl necklace in town.

09:44.870 --> 09:45.670
And this.

09:46.630 --> 09:48.270
We're getting married the day after tomorrow.

09:48.770 --> 09:49.890
I'll leave this little notebook

09:50.080 --> 09:51.630
with you for safekeeping.

09:52.030 --> 09:53.240
It's now like

09:53.240 --> 09:54.360
half my life to me.

09:54.600 --> 09:55.750
I'm afraid

09:55.750 --> 09:56.960
I might forget it too in the future.

09:57.270 --> 09:58.480
I'll feel at ease leaving it with you.

10:03.320 --> 10:05.150
You're not afraid of forgetting me too, huh?

10:05.750 --> 10:07.030
What are you talking about?

10:07.200 --> 10:08.440
Even if I forget myself,

10:08.440 --> 10:09.550
I could never forget you.

10:16.950 --> 10:18.030
Greetings, Young Mistress.

10:19.000 --> 10:20.200
How is his injury?

10:20.670 --> 10:21.630
Not good.

10:22.320 --> 10:23.200
Has he regained consciousness?

10:42.960 --> 10:43.750
Tanghua?

10:46.480 --> 10:47.270
Tanghua.

11:21.960 --> 11:25.330
♫I gaze into your deep eyes♫

11:26.310 --> 11:29.590
♫For whom do you take apart the word "love"?♫

11:31.780 --> 11:35.080
♫Turning around, it's like a dream♫

11:33.360 --> 11:34.150
Let me do it.

11:37.180 --> 11:41.290
♫I have betrayed deep love♫

11:42.260 --> 11:43.570
Go fetch a plum candy.

11:43.580 --> 11:47.430
♫Heaving a long, helpless sigh♫

11:44.150 --> 11:44.910
Mr. Tanghua

11:44.910 --> 11:46.510
can't even swallow medicine right now.

11:46.600 --> 11:48.080
How could he possibly eat candy?

11:48.250 --> 11:52.170
♫Time flies too rapidly♫

11:50.200 --> 11:51.000
It's for me.

11:52.670 --> 11:53.480
Yes, Young Mistress.

11:54.460 --> 11:58.120
♫Life is like a flying bird♫

11:58.710 --> 12:03.600
♫Joining, scattering, no way back♫

12:04.710 --> 12:07.850
♫Unable to get what I yearn for, I sink in sadness♫

12:10.070 --> 12:14.210
♫When I brush past love, fate is set♫

12:15.070 --> 12:17.610
♫I've used up my brush and ink♫

12:17.900 --> 12:21.110
♫I couldn't describe♫

12:21.200 --> 12:25.490
♫This lovesick path♫

12:27.240 --> 12:28.910
Yunniang, why are you here?

12:29.240 --> 12:30.440
Are you here to check on the furniture?

12:31.080 --> 12:31.870
Not at all.

12:31.870 --> 12:33.270
I trust your craftsmanship.

12:33.960 --> 12:35.030
Then why are you here?

12:36.240 --> 12:37.270
I'm here to drop this off.

12:39.150 --> 12:39.960
What's wrong with it?

12:41.750 --> 12:43.200
Originally, we only needed one box of fireworks.

12:43.390 --> 12:44.270
But Pei Jiu actually forgot

12:44.270 --> 12:45.360
that he had already sent one two days ago

12:45.420 --> 12:46.420
and sent another box today.

12:47.440 --> 12:48.630
Pei Jiu is not himself today.

12:48.870 --> 12:50.480
His memory shouldn't be this poor.

12:50.870 --> 12:52.750
Is he... is he sick?

12:53.670 --> 12:55.120
At first, I thought so too.

12:55.150 --> 12:56.510
But after thinking it over,

12:56.550 --> 12:57.710
that doesn't seem to be the case.

12:58.270 --> 12:59.240
This memory problem of his

12:59.440 --> 13:00.750
seems to have started when he began learning martial arts

13:00.750 --> 13:01.910
from your young master.

13:04.790 --> 13:06.870
Tanyin, I don't think of you as an outsider.

13:07.590 --> 13:08.760
I won't beat around the bush.

13:08.840 --> 13:10.440
Could you ask your young master

13:10.630 --> 13:11.550
if Pei Jiu's condition

13:11.960 --> 13:13.550
has anything to do with learning martial arts?

13:13.790 --> 13:15.150
I'm really worried about him.

13:23.150 --> 13:23.870
Do you think

13:23.870 --> 13:25.510
once Pei Jiu regains his memories,

13:25.510 --> 13:27.080
his personally will completely change?

13:27.790 --> 13:28.750
I wonder if the proprietress

13:28.750 --> 13:30.440
will still like him.

13:31.000 --> 13:31.790
Can they

13:31.790 --> 13:33.240
still be together happily?

13:33.670 --> 13:34.750
Recently,

13:34.750 --> 13:36.030
my memory has been poor.

13:36.210 --> 13:37.940
Look at my brain.

13:38.200 --> 13:40.320
When I went to the government office today,

13:41.040 --> 13:43.760
I couldn't even remember what the magistrate looked like.

14:28.000 --> 14:29.320
The town hasn't been peaceful lately.

14:29.560 --> 14:30.320
Near the abandoned temple,

14:30.350 --> 14:31.960
several young beggars have gone missing.

16:08.360 --> 16:13.110
[Yesterday's Inn]

16:43.240 --> 16:44.030
Master,

16:44.510 --> 16:45.360
why do I always feel that something is missing

16:45.360 --> 16:46.600
when I use my spiritual power

16:47.910 --> 16:49.320
to break through my Spirit Courtyard?

16:50.870 --> 16:52.120
Did you...

16:52.240 --> 16:53.240
What do you want to say?

16:55.450 --> 16:56.480
Hold something back?

16:57.630 --> 16:58.750
When we first started teaching you,

16:58.750 --> 16:59.960
you acted like we were trying to harm you.

17:00.000 --> 17:01.200
Now, you want to learn more.

17:01.390 --> 17:02.630
I've taught you all the techniques

17:02.910 --> 17:04.160
that I needed to teach you.

17:04.440 --> 17:05.640
The last step—breaking through your Spirit Courtyard—

17:06.000 --> 17:07.240
is something you must do on your own.

17:07.750 --> 17:08.829
I can't help you with this.

17:12.270 --> 17:13.510
Fine, I'll do it myself.

17:13.640 --> 17:15.030
What's the big deal?

17:19.069 --> 17:20.160
That's enough for today.

17:20.480 --> 17:21.200
You can go back now.

17:21.200 --> 17:21.920
Kai Shan!

17:22.670 --> 17:23.460
Master.

17:25.960 --> 17:27.069
I've noticed recently

17:27.069 --> 17:28.109
that my memory has become very poor.

17:28.109 --> 17:29.070
I keep forgetting things.

17:30.050 --> 17:31.290
Do you think it might have something to do

17:31.310 --> 17:32.800
with the technique I've been practicing?

17:38.160 --> 17:40.070
If I keep practicing like this,

17:40.480 --> 17:42.110
will there be any problems?

17:54.030 --> 17:54.830
Yuanzhong.

18:03.240 --> 18:04.240
What are you doing here?

18:04.840 --> 18:05.660
Recently, Pei Jiu

18:05.690 --> 18:07.010
has suddenly become very forgetful.

18:07.150 --> 18:07.870
He seems to have forgotten

18:07.890 --> 18:09.370
many people and things from his past.

18:09.510 --> 18:10.160
Does this have something

18:10.160 --> 18:11.000
to do with the technique

18:11.000 --> 18:11.960
you taught him?

18:18.300 --> 18:19.460
-Let's talk over there.
-Don't go!

18:20.000 --> 18:21.400
This concerns his future.

18:21.400 --> 18:22.720
Why can't he listen?

18:22.790 --> 18:23.830
What do you want to say?

18:23.830 --> 18:24.440
If Pei Jiu

18:24.440 --> 18:25.720
continues like this,

18:26.310 --> 18:27.310
will he forget

18:27.310 --> 18:28.880
everything about Pei Jiu

18:29.160 --> 18:30.790
and regain his memories as Lu Chen?

18:31.000 --> 18:32.920
By then, Pei Jiu will no longer be Pei Jiu

18:33.310 --> 18:34.510
but will have become Lu Chen, right?

18:35.240 --> 18:36.480
Who is Lu Chen?

18:37.110 --> 18:38.640
Why would I no longer be myself?

19:00.310 --> 19:02.160
Chief, we've brought back two more.

19:02.850 --> 19:04.370
It's almost time.

19:06.630 --> 19:07.910
It's almost time.

19:11.070 --> 19:12.070
Beautiful.

19:13.030 --> 19:15.160
You're such a good boy.

19:15.310 --> 19:17.640
So scared, yet still so good.

19:17.960 --> 19:19.200
Good, good, good.

19:22.640 --> 19:23.720
You guessed right.

19:24.400 --> 19:25.350
He will indeed forget

19:25.350 --> 19:26.400
everything about now,

19:26.640 --> 19:27.640
become Lu Chen again,

19:28.240 --> 19:29.750
and leave this place with me.

19:30.510 --> 19:31.310
M-Master.

19:32.680 --> 19:34.440
What do you mean by that?

19:36.240 --> 19:37.070
It means

19:37.590 --> 19:38.880
you are not Pei Jiu

19:39.160 --> 19:40.110
but Lu Chen.

19:40.550 --> 19:42.200
I'm helping you find your true self.

19:43.240 --> 19:44.400
What about Yunniang?

19:45.510 --> 19:46.720
She has been waiting for so long

19:46.750 --> 19:48.400
just to marry Pei Jiu.

19:48.640 --> 19:50.030
She has even prepared her wedding attire.

19:50.030 --> 19:50.960
In two more days,

19:50.960 --> 19:52.200
she will get married.

19:52.200 --> 19:53.790
And now, you're making Pei Jiu forget Yunniang

19:53.790 --> 19:54.680
and everything.

19:54.680 --> 19:56.160
How is this any different from killing him?

19:56.310 --> 19:57.640
For him, this place is

19:58.240 --> 19:59.550
nothing but a grand dream.

19:59.830 --> 20:00.750
When the dream ends,

20:01.310 --> 20:03.240
he should return to who he truly is.

20:03.240 --> 20:04.310
This is not a dream.

20:04.310 --> 20:05.110
So what?

20:05.480 --> 20:06.310
You should at least give him

20:06.310 --> 20:07.480
the right to choose.

20:21.590 --> 20:22.790
Who do you think you are?

20:24.230 --> 20:26.070
What right do you have to interfere in my affairs?

20:26.830 --> 20:27.880
I don't think this is

20:27.880 --> 20:29.000
just your affair.

20:29.240 --> 20:30.350
It's also about Pei Jiu and Yunniang's

20:30.350 --> 20:31.440
lifelong happiness.

20:31.880 --> 20:33.790
How kind of you to care so much for them.

20:33.790 --> 20:35.510
I'm kind to everyone.

20:35.960 --> 20:37.110
You know that.

20:39.590 --> 20:40.480
Sometimes,

20:41.390 --> 20:42.630
excessive kindness

20:43.910 --> 20:45.420
is its own form of cruelty.

20:49.480 --> 20:50.440
Do... do you...

20:50.440 --> 20:51.830
do you know something?

20:54.110 --> 20:55.400
You didn't hide it very well.

20:55.830 --> 20:57.200
I wasn't trying to hide from you.

20:57.400 --> 20:58.400
It's just that earlier I...

21:01.200 --> 21:01.830
These past few days,

21:01.830 --> 21:03.110
I've been thinking about one thing.

21:04.400 --> 21:05.110
Why did you

21:05.110 --> 21:06.310
come to my side?

21:10.440 --> 21:11.720
Is it also because of this?

21:12.160 --> 21:13.440
You also want to kill me

21:13.440 --> 21:14.480
and then take it?

21:14.480 --> 21:15.310
I don't.

21:15.590 --> 21:16.440
I never wanted to harm you.

21:16.440 --> 21:17.400
Then what do you want?

21:17.880 --> 21:19.270
To change me? Influence me?

21:19.270 --> 21:20.400
To make me become like you

21:20.400 --> 21:21.920
to save all living beings and spare the War Demons?

21:21.920 --> 21:22.960
You're overthinking it!

21:22.960 --> 21:23.350
I just want to...

21:23.350 --> 21:24.510
I don't care what you want.

21:24.790 --> 21:26.000
It doesn't matter to me.

21:27.580 --> 21:28.380
Ji Tanyin.

21:29.640 --> 21:30.310
Perhaps I should

21:30.310 --> 21:31.750
call you the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain.

21:32.510 --> 21:34.110
I'm curious about one thing.

21:34.440 --> 21:36.210
Would someone who has lived for over a thousand years

21:36.270 --> 21:37.000
still consider

21:37.000 --> 21:38.440
themselves human?

21:39.110 --> 21:40.000
Or do they believe they've

21:40.000 --> 21:41.720
already ascended to immortality,

21:41.720 --> 21:42.960
transcended all living beings,

21:43.030 --> 21:44.440
and become a god?

21:46.880 --> 21:48.160
You and I have different positions.

21:48.970 --> 21:50.890
I have no right to criticize you for anything.

21:50.920 --> 21:51.830
But likewise,

21:51.830 --> 21:53.510
don't try to influence me

21:53.510 --> 21:54.480
or change me!

21:54.790 --> 21:56.110
You've never been in my position,

21:56.110 --> 21:58.000
seen what I've seen, and felt what I've felt,

21:58.070 --> 21:58.880
so naturally, you won't understand

21:58.880 --> 22:00.270
why I do what I do.

22:01.440 --> 22:02.640
I know exactly

22:02.920 --> 22:04.270
what I want

22:04.510 --> 22:05.520
and what I'm doing.

22:05.850 --> 22:06.840
No one

22:07.400 --> 22:09.030
can change my decision...

22:10.680 --> 22:11.830
not even

22:12.680 --> 22:13.680
a god.

22:17.270 --> 22:18.160
Very well. Very well.

22:18.850 --> 22:20.000
Very well. Very well.

22:23.610 --> 22:26.000
Why not draw blood from the forehead?

22:26.720 --> 22:28.790
The children of the human race

22:29.490 --> 22:30.470
don't have as much power

22:30.510 --> 22:32.790
in their blood as we do.

22:33.620 --> 22:36.620
Taking blood from the forehead won't work.

22:43.400 --> 22:44.200
Come on.

22:44.580 --> 22:45.380
Come on, come on.

23:06.310 --> 23:07.110
Ji Tanyin.

23:08.000 --> 23:08.880
Give up.

23:09.440 --> 23:10.750
You can't influence me,

23:11.160 --> 23:12.590
much less change me.

23:14.480 --> 23:15.510
I am not a good person.

23:15.790 --> 23:17.030
The path I walk

23:17.270 --> 23:18.750
is also completely different from yours.

23:19.510 --> 23:20.480
Let's part ways forever

23:21.170 --> 23:22.200
and leave each other alone.

23:23.100 --> 23:23.900
It's good

23:24.510 --> 23:25.310
for you

23:26.310 --> 23:27.350
and for me.

23:51.270 --> 23:52.880
Miss... Miss Ji?

24:15.330 --> 24:16.370
Possessing technique.

24:16.430 --> 24:17.320
Die!

24:50.580 --> 24:52.400
Ghost Ancestor of Darkness, Fallen Ruler of Tombs.

24:52.400 --> 24:54.200
With the blood of battles, I command the spirits of war.

24:54.200 --> 24:56.200
Take my body, seize my soul.

24:56.200 --> 24:58.270
With my hatred as your blade, strike down my foes.

25:02.270 --> 25:03.080
Restrain her!

25:27.030 --> 25:27.840
Wake up!

25:35.400 --> 25:37.030
Take my body, seize my soul.

25:37.060 --> 25:39.220
With my hatred as your blade, strike down my foes.

25:43.320 --> 25:44.950
With my hatred as your blade, strike down my foes.

26:03.540 --> 26:04.670
We can't hold back anymore!

26:07.050 --> 26:08.210
Zi Fei, stop!

26:36.880 --> 26:38.510
You're the War Demon from the tower ship?

26:39.360 --> 26:41.200
That's right. It's me!

26:51.130 --> 26:51.930
Yuanzhong!

27:10.000 --> 27:11.330
I can't believe they failed.

27:14.250 --> 27:15.690
I told you long ago.

27:16.310 --> 27:18.000
If they were truly capable,

27:18.270 --> 27:19.070
they wouldn't have ended up

27:19.070 --> 27:20.480
in this sorry state.

27:20.790 --> 27:22.030
The stupidity of the War Demons

27:22.400 --> 27:23.680
is beyond redemption.

27:24.240 --> 27:26.310
You'd better say something useful.

27:27.000 --> 27:28.070
Something useful?

27:31.000 --> 27:31.920
That little goddess

27:31.920 --> 27:33.550
is no longer under your control.

27:33.920 --> 27:34.750
You've practically

27:34.750 --> 27:36.510
sent Yuanzhong a helper.

27:37.160 --> 27:38.680
No matter what you want to do,

27:38.830 --> 27:40.240
as long as she's around,

27:40.480 --> 27:42.160
everything will be twice as difficult.

27:42.830 --> 27:43.640
So,

27:44.270 --> 27:45.230
kill her.

27:45.880 --> 27:47.160
Eliminate Ji Tanyin

27:47.720 --> 27:49.350
or hand her over to me.

27:52.680 --> 27:54.680
Hannv, how dare you!

27:54.680 --> 27:56.250
I dare to do even more.

27:57.000 --> 27:58.280
Would you like to try it?

28:09.270 --> 28:10.550
Who are these people?

28:11.480 --> 28:12.720
And who are you?

28:12.980 --> 28:14.460
What's going on here?

28:15.680 --> 28:16.830
It's a long story.

28:16.830 --> 28:18.350
Then tell me from the beginning.

28:20.350 --> 28:22.030
Come on, tell me!

28:22.070 --> 28:22.880
Jiu!

28:24.440 --> 28:25.240
Something terrible has happened!

28:26.170 --> 28:27.330
Madam is missing.

28:27.960 --> 28:28.880
Missing?

28:29.310 --> 28:30.350
I just got up to use the bathroom

28:30.370 --> 28:31.200
and saw her room door wide open.

28:31.200 --> 28:32.030
I went in to check

28:32.030 --> 28:33.110
and found this.

28:33.830 --> 28:34.750
"I'm going after the thief.

28:34.880 --> 28:36.110
If I can't return in time,

28:36.110 --> 28:37.310
quickly inform Pei Jiu."

28:37.310 --> 28:38.350
When did she leave?

28:38.880 --> 28:39.680
I don't know.

28:41.270 --> 28:42.070
Pei Jiu!

28:43.810 --> 28:49.170
[Turn Around]

28:52.920 --> 28:53.830
What's this?

28:54.310 --> 28:55.400
It's one of the pearls from the necklace

28:55.400 --> 28:56.240
I just gave to Yunniang.

28:56.440 --> 28:57.070
Then she must be

28:57.070 --> 28:58.240
dropping these as a clue for us.

28:58.240 --> 28:58.960
Let's go quickly.

29:10.840 --> 29:13.090
[Zi Ke; War Demon]

29:18.200 --> 29:19.000
How is it?

29:19.030 --> 29:20.470
The High Priest of the Youhu Clan is coming after us.

29:20.830 --> 29:22.160
We should go. Help here.

29:22.160 --> 29:22.790
Let's go.

29:40.960 --> 29:41.750
Gushan?

29:44.240 --> 29:46.270
I was thinking of making an embroidery piece

29:46.270 --> 29:47.790
as your birthday gift.

29:48.050 --> 29:49.940
I need your birth date and time for that.

29:51.020 --> 29:52.540
Why don't you write it down for me?

29:54.240 --> 29:55.030
It seems

29:55.590 --> 29:56.680
that it's Hannv

29:56.680 --> 29:57.680
who leaked my birth date and name

29:57.680 --> 29:59.400
to the War Demons.

29:59.720 --> 30:01.720
She wanted to use the War Demons and me

30:02.110 --> 30:03.590
to kill Yuanzhong.

30:08.680 --> 30:09.880
It's only been a few miles of mountain road,

30:09.920 --> 30:11.470
b-but why is it so cold up here?

30:12.720 --> 30:14.070
Gushan is covered in snow all year round.

30:14.070 --> 30:15.110
It has always been so.

30:15.830 --> 30:16.640
Miss Ji,

30:16.960 --> 30:18.000
have you been here before?

30:20.270 --> 30:21.680
War Demons. Let's go.

30:32.030 --> 30:33.160
Where's that woman?

30:33.200 --> 30:34.350
We've already locked her up.

30:34.370 --> 30:35.260
Kill her.

30:36.110 --> 30:36.920
Yes.

30:38.880 --> 30:40.310
Chief, someone is trespassing on the mountain.

30:45.250 --> 30:46.730
Halt, intruders.

30:47.400 --> 30:48.920
Why do you still move forward?

30:49.960 --> 30:50.790
Young lady,

30:50.990 --> 30:52.140
all beings suffer.

30:52.510 --> 30:54.550
It's better to turn back now.

30:55.090 --> 30:57.480
You two are not my enemies.

30:57.510 --> 31:00.030
Don't throw your lives away by moving forward.

30:58.390 --> 30:59.760
[Elder Ku Sheng; War Demon]

31:01.110 --> 31:02.030
How interesting.

31:02.830 --> 31:04.310
You're clearly not cultivators,

31:04.310 --> 31:04.720
yet you speak

31:04.720 --> 31:06.200
like them.

31:06.200 --> 31:08.790
We have been practicing meditation for 60 years.

31:09.270 --> 31:10.720
Although we have no intention of becoming cultivators,

31:11.070 --> 31:12.960
we have attained the mind of dharma.

31:13.160 --> 31:14.270
If you have attained the mind of dharma,

31:14.400 --> 31:16.550
why do you still trouble the people of the mortal realm?

31:17.350 --> 31:18.480
You're here for

31:18.790 --> 31:20.790
that human child, aren't you?

31:19.380 --> 31:20.430
[Elder Duo Nan; War Demon]

31:21.060 --> 31:22.650
This is also a necessary measure.

31:22.830 --> 31:24.590
Everything comes at a price.

31:24.790 --> 31:26.590
Our clan wishes to slay demons and eliminate evil

31:26.640 --> 31:28.680
to pull out the poisonous tumor from this world.

31:28.920 --> 31:30.840
And they are the price for that.

31:30.870 --> 31:31.500
You...

31:32.430 --> 31:33.640
Without bait,

31:33.770 --> 31:35.620
how can we lure the snake out to kill it?

31:36.110 --> 31:37.030
Sometimes,

31:37.110 --> 31:39.910
killing is also a form of good.

31:41.400 --> 31:42.550
What a price to pay.

31:42.670 --> 31:43.830
What a form of good.

31:44.200 --> 31:45.720
May I ask, who is the snake

31:45.970 --> 31:47.050
you are referring to?

31:47.400 --> 31:48.960
The person we want to kill.

31:49.060 --> 31:50.220
That's right, that's right.

31:50.550 --> 31:52.030
That person is

31:52.030 --> 31:53.830
the biggest venomous snake under heaven.

31:52.390 --> 31:53.730
[Elder Bei He; War Demon]

31:53.920 --> 31:55.110
Sixty years ago,

31:55.530 --> 31:57.940
this fiend almost wiped out our entire clan.

31:58.030 --> 31:59.640
Half of our Twelve War Generals

31:59.640 --> 32:02.070
also fell by his hand.

32:02.230 --> 32:03.640
Twelve halved leaves six,

32:04.190 --> 32:05.430
but there are only three of you.

32:05.450 --> 32:07.610
This is precisely his cruelty.

32:07.750 --> 32:10.790
He allowed his Youhu Clan to reign supreme,

32:10.860 --> 32:13.690
making our clan hunted by everyone in the mortal realm.

32:14.000 --> 32:14.790
We had no choice

32:15.510 --> 32:17.920
but to hide in this desolate mountain.

32:18.240 --> 32:19.680
For 60 years,

32:19.960 --> 32:21.720
we were powerless to seek revenge.

32:21.750 --> 32:23.850
We could only sit in meditation,

32:25.030 --> 32:26.680
waiting for our lives to fade away.

32:27.000 --> 32:28.830
The years of meditation have flown by.

32:29.270 --> 32:30.830
Of the six brothers from back then,

32:30.880 --> 32:31.960
now only

32:31.960 --> 32:33.590
we three old fools remain.

32:34.350 --> 32:36.260
Time has grayed our hair

32:37.110 --> 32:38.510
and withered our flesh.

32:39.590 --> 32:42.310
But the one thing that has never changed is our hatred for him.

32:42.790 --> 32:43.590
That's right.

32:43.920 --> 32:45.000
All these years,

32:45.240 --> 32:47.960
it's been the deep-seated hatred for that fiend

32:48.680 --> 32:50.440
that has kept us three alive.

32:50.890 --> 32:53.520
Hearing that the Chief wanted to deal with that person,

32:54.160 --> 32:56.350
we are here to guard the mountain

32:56.640 --> 32:58.270
and protect her

32:58.720 --> 33:00.920
in case he becomes desperate

33:01.790 --> 33:03.200
and comes seeking revenge.

33:04.400 --> 33:05.240
Understood.

33:05.590 --> 33:06.790
Since you understand,

33:07.350 --> 33:08.510
why not turn back?

33:08.590 --> 33:09.790
The person you want to kill

33:09.790 --> 33:10.880
will not come.

33:11.030 --> 33:11.830
Why is that?

33:12.350 --> 33:13.830
He's a snake that has long grown weary of life.

33:15.720 --> 33:17.240
Your insignificant lives

33:17.680 --> 33:18.920
won't startle him from his hibernation.

33:20.020 --> 33:21.430
But your wait will not be in vain.

33:21.880 --> 33:23.000
The debt he owes,

33:23.110 --> 33:24.030
I'll repay.

33:24.030 --> 33:25.160
Who are you?

33:25.270 --> 33:26.790
I'm the one who wants him alive.

33:44.720 --> 33:45.510
Yuanzhong.

33:45.720 --> 33:47.110
They've brought quite the crowd.

33:47.750 --> 33:48.550
It's not surprising.

33:49.200 --> 33:50.000
After all, we've reached

33:50.000 --> 33:51.160
the territory of Gushan.

33:51.160 --> 33:52.680
The possessing technique that Ji Tanyin fell victim to

33:52.680 --> 33:54.200
must be their doing as well.

33:55.200 --> 33:56.270
Impressive.

33:56.960 --> 33:57.920
Even I couldn't figure out

33:57.920 --> 33:59.160
Ji Tanyin's background,

33:59.510 --> 34:00.790
yet they already know.

34:00.790 --> 34:01.960
So what should we do now?

34:02.070 --> 34:02.880
What to do?

34:03.590 --> 34:05.110
If they have gotten a death wish,

34:05.720 --> 34:07.270
then I might as well grant it to them.

34:18.540 --> 34:19.580
If you want to kill us,

34:19.920 --> 34:21.000
just do it.

34:21.030 --> 34:22.389
Do you really want to die that much?

34:22.670 --> 34:24.670
Can the abyss of resentment carved open by killing

34:25.030 --> 34:27.230
ever be filled by more killing?

34:30.100 --> 34:31.500
It seems you truly don't understand.

34:31.739 --> 34:33.340
As expected, your sixty years of cultivation have been wasted.

34:34.230 --> 34:35.030
Let's go.

34:36.440 --> 34:37.230
Don't go.

34:37.250 --> 34:38.650
Don't go. Kill me.

34:39.550 --> 34:40.630
Your sword is right beside you.

34:41.070 --> 34:42.110
If you truly have no will to live,

34:42.110 --> 34:43.360
you can end it yourself.

34:43.600 --> 34:45.560
But don't blame your death

34:45.590 --> 34:47.239
on others.

34:49.190 --> 34:50.800
Using your lives to fish for fame and honor

34:51.290 --> 34:52.920
is truly despicable.

35:06.280 --> 35:07.000
Chief,

35:07.000 --> 35:07.880
it's a man and a woman.

35:07.880 --> 35:08.880
Their blades are very sharp.

35:08.880 --> 35:10.230
Elder Ku Sheng and the other two were no match.

35:12.840 --> 35:14.400
Activate the mountain protection formation.

35:15.110 --> 35:16.360
Since they dare to come,

35:16.880 --> 35:18.510
we should make sure they never leave.

35:19.000 --> 35:19.800
Yes.

35:25.800 --> 35:26.670
What's that?

35:27.240 --> 35:28.840
It's the War Demon's mountain protection formation.

35:30.710 --> 35:31.760
It seems the War Demons

35:31.760 --> 35:33.110
have indeed abducted many children of the human race

35:33.110 --> 35:34.190
and brought them up here.

35:34.480 --> 35:35.320
Yunniang must have found out

35:35.320 --> 35:36.070
their whereabouts,

35:36.070 --> 35:37.280
and that's why she followed.

35:37.320 --> 35:39.190
Let's split up.

35:39.400 --> 35:40.360
I'll go break the formation

35:40.510 --> 35:41.670
to divert their attention.

35:41.840 --> 35:42.920
You go find Yunniang.

35:42.920 --> 35:43.580
Okay.

35:43.800 --> 35:45.070
But remember:

35:45.320 --> 35:46.440
no matter what dangers you encounter,

35:46.440 --> 35:47.440
don't fight hard.

35:47.760 --> 35:48.840
If Yuanzhong returns

35:48.840 --> 35:50.030
and finds we're not there,

35:50.070 --> 35:51.290
he will surely come for us.

35:51.360 --> 35:52.190
Once he arrives,

35:52.190 --> 35:53.670
everything will change for the better.

35:53.950 --> 35:54.750
Miss Ji,

35:55.960 --> 35:57.150
was everything you and my master said

35:57.150 --> 35:58.190
last night true?

35:58.710 --> 35:59.710
If I continue

36:00.110 --> 36:01.670
practicing that technique,

36:02.190 --> 36:03.230
I'll forget myself

36:03.590 --> 36:04.840
and become someone else entirely?

36:05.760 --> 36:06.550
Yes.

36:07.550 --> 36:08.550
But Pei Jiu,

36:08.880 --> 36:10.590
Lu Chen is Yuanzhong's friend.

36:11.070 --> 36:12.150
They're friends for life who have been through

36:12.150 --> 36:13.190
thick and thin together.

36:14.070 --> 36:15.240
If you were gone,

36:15.320 --> 36:16.760
Yunniang would be heartbroken,

36:16.840 --> 36:17.840
and so would I,

36:18.030 --> 36:18.960
because we only know

36:18.960 --> 36:19.920
the current you.

36:20.230 --> 36:21.440
But looking at it from their angle,

36:21.760 --> 36:23.320
if Yuanzhong lost his friend,

36:24.190 --> 36:25.880
he would be just as upset.

36:26.630 --> 36:27.920
In this matter,

36:28.110 --> 36:29.670
everyone has their own stance.

36:29.670 --> 36:31.000
There's no right or wrong.

36:31.280 --> 36:32.840
You only need to remember one thing:

36:33.190 --> 36:34.550
whether you're Pei Jiu

36:35.150 --> 36:36.110
or Lu Chen,

36:36.280 --> 36:37.710
you're not alone.

36:38.510 --> 36:39.960
We all care about you.

36:41.920 --> 36:42.880
I understand.

36:43.870 --> 36:45.870
Thank you, Miss Ji.

36:47.510 --> 36:48.320
Let's go.

38:11.000 --> 38:12.510
How did you get here so quickly?

38:12.800 --> 38:13.590
Any slower,

38:13.590 --> 38:15.440
and you'd have become wolf chow.

38:15.840 --> 38:16.880
Don't underestimate me.

38:18.780 --> 38:20.490
Why are there so many vicious wolves?

38:21.020 --> 38:23.060
Where there are vicious wolves, there must be a vicious master.

38:27.730 --> 38:30.640
The High Priest of the Youhu Clan has personally arrived.

38:31.400 --> 38:32.880
What an impressive display of skill.

38:33.370 --> 38:35.480
Indeed, the vicious master has appeared.

38:38.150 --> 38:39.110
Who is she?

38:39.710 --> 38:41.230
The new chief of the War Demon,

38:41.280 --> 38:42.200
Li Chaoyang.

38:43.030 --> 38:43.840
Surname Li?

38:45.410 --> 38:46.850
What's your relation to Li Changtian?

38:47.900 --> 38:49.220
He was my father.

38:50.740 --> 38:51.860
I see.

38:52.590 --> 38:53.840
If we're speaking in those terms,

38:54.030 --> 38:56.200
she should call you uncle.

38:56.230 --> 38:57.020
How dare you!

39:09.630 --> 39:10.440
Yuanzhong.

39:11.440 --> 39:13.880
You are the sworn enemy of our clan

39:14.400 --> 39:16.280
and the lifelong hatred of my father.

39:16.830 --> 39:18.750
Today, if I take your life,

39:19.400 --> 39:21.400
it'll be heaven's justice.

39:21.670 --> 39:22.510
With just you?

39:23.190 --> 39:24.630
And these few rabid dogs of yours?

39:24.920 --> 39:27.400
I'm afraid you're the only one who'll be meeting your maker.

39:27.420 --> 39:28.530
Such arrogance.

40:10.410 --> 40:11.120
This won't do.

40:11.150 --> 40:12.470
We must find a way to break their formation.

40:20.590 --> 40:21.480
That move is not bad.

40:21.760 --> 40:22.590
And then?

40:23.150 --> 40:23.960
Then?

40:24.510 --> 40:26.630
Wait for me to gather my strength and break out.

40:29.440 --> 40:30.480
Little one?

40:31.550 --> 40:32.630
Little one?

40:33.320 --> 40:35.590
Can you hear me?

40:36.360 --> 40:37.150
What's wrong with you?

40:37.150 --> 40:38.550
I know you heard me.

40:38.550 --> 40:39.400
What happened?

40:39.400 --> 40:41.070
This is not up to you.

40:41.270 --> 40:43.140
Come and meet me.

40:45.760 --> 40:46.550
Yuanzhong?

40:46.550 --> 40:47.360
Don't move.

40:48.440 --> 40:49.800
He seems to be in a meditative trance.

40:49.880 --> 40:50.670
Meditative trance?

40:51.060 --> 40:52.910
With an enemy at the gates, he meditates?

40:52.930 --> 40:54.440
This wasn't his choice.

40:54.960 --> 40:55.960
Something's off here.

40:56.190 --> 40:57.070
I'm going to check.

40:57.150 --> 40:57.960
Check?

40:58.390 --> 40:59.200
How?

41:00.030 --> 41:00.960
This barrier should be able to be

41:00.960 --> 41:02.030
reinforced with magical power.

41:02.250 --> 41:03.080
You stand guard.

41:33.190 --> 41:34.000
Yuanzhong?

41:39.710 --> 41:40.710
You're injured.

41:41.670 --> 41:42.670
Injured, yes.

41:43.190 --> 41:44.670
But I'm not the person you're looking for.

41:45.670 --> 41:46.840
You're not Yuanzhong.

41:47.080 --> 41:48.690
Yes and no.

41:48.770 --> 41:50.450
This is Yuanzhong's Cave of Spiritual Consciousness,

41:50.760 --> 41:53.110
and I am the essence of his spiritual consciousness.

41:54.150 --> 41:55.630
You're the essence of his spiritual consciousness?

41:56.090 --> 41:58.220
Then... why are you injured?

41:58.250 --> 41:59.000
Demon Dragon.

41:59.360 --> 42:00.150
Demon Dragon?

42:00.950 --> 42:02.310
During the war between gods and demons,

42:02.570 --> 42:04.300
the Demon God had a demon dragon as his mount.

42:04.580 --> 42:05.870
When the Demon God was defeated,

42:06.150 --> 42:07.880
his demon dragon also fell to the mortal realm.

42:08.030 --> 42:09.670
Although its physical body was destroyed,

42:09.670 --> 42:10.670
its spiritual consciousness

42:10.670 --> 42:12.510
fell into a slumber in Orange Lake.

42:12.800 --> 42:14.800
It might have never seen the light of day again.

42:15.360 --> 42:16.630
However, Lu Chen's arrival

42:16.670 --> 42:17.880
awakened it.

42:18.070 --> 42:19.110
It then took the opportunity

42:19.230 --> 42:20.920
and entered Lu Chen's body.

42:21.320 --> 42:22.400
This was also the reason

42:22.400 --> 42:24.320
why Lu Chen was severely injured and lost his memory in the first place.

42:25.320 --> 42:26.510
So that's what happened.

42:26.960 --> 42:28.960
Later, when Yuanzhong was teaching Lu Chen,

42:29.230 --> 42:30.190
the Demon Dragon thought

42:30.190 --> 42:31.280
that Yuanzhong would be an even better

42:31.280 --> 42:32.320
vessel to possess.

42:32.710 --> 42:35.030
So it transformed into a wisp of demonic energy

42:35.110 --> 42:36.070
and entered Yuanzhong's

42:36.070 --> 42:37.070
sea of consciousness.

42:37.710 --> 42:38.840
I fought against it for days,

42:38.840 --> 42:39.880
but in the end, I was no match for it.

42:40.190 --> 42:41.360
It severely wounded me

42:41.550 --> 42:42.760
and then entered the cave.

42:43.440 --> 42:44.630
The Demon Dragon entered

42:45.030 --> 42:46.480
Yuanzhong's Cave of Spiritual Consciousness?
